  "reasoning": "The defendant ordered the cutting down of a forest of fir trees (杉林木) without obtaining the required forestry cutting permit. This constitutes illegal logging, which under Chinese criminal law is classified as the crime of illegal felling and destruction of forest resources, especially when it involves protected forest vegetation. No other criminal conduct is described in the facts. Therefore the appropriate charge is illegal felling and destruction of protected forest vegetation.",
